## ===================================================================
## Portfolio Code-Reading (Preserve Folder Structure, Exclude Logic)
## ===================================================================
# Exclude all files inside backend & test projects
src/TokoBuku.Domain/**
src/TokoBuku.Application/**
src/TokoBuku.Infrastructure/**
tests/**

# Allow directory traversal so folder structures remain recognized by Git
!src/TokoBuku.Domain/
!src/TokoBuku.Domain/**/
!src/TokoBuku.Application/
!src/TokoBuku.Application/**/
!src/TokoBuku.Infrastructure/
!src/TokoBuku.Infrastructure/**/
!tests/
!tests/**/

# Track structural placeholders (.gitkeep & README.md)
!src/TokoBuku.Domain/**/.gitkeep
!src/TokoBuku.Application/**/.gitkeep
!src/TokoBuku.Infrastructure/**/.gitkeep
!tests/**/.gitkeep
!src/TokoBuku.Domain/**/README.md
!src/TokoBuku.Application/**/README.md
!src/TokoBuku.Infrastructure/**/README.md
!tests/**/README.md
TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md

## ===================================================================
## App Configuration & Database Secrets (Never push live database settings)
## ===================================================================
# Completely ignore all active configuration files that contain real database connection strings
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
*.Development.json
*.Production.json
*.Local.json
*.local.json

# Whitelist ONLY sanitized template/example files
!appsettings.example.json
!appsettings-example.json
!appsettings-example.Development.json

## ===================================================================
## .NET / Visual Studio Environment & User Caches
## ===================================================================
TokoBuku.slnLaunch.user
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates

